title: "edgar-itemize"
abstract: "A deterministic, rule-based parser that recovers the agenda structure (Part, Item, sub-heading; Article, Section, clause) of SEC EDGAR filings and addresses every node by byte offset into the raw submission file, with no machine learning inside the parser."
